{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_74","type":"agent_message","text":"MemorySanitizer confirms the C failure is a use of uninitialized proxy data in `c2GJK` at `lib.c:506`, reached from the public `c2CapsuletoPolyManifold`; Clang also reports the missing `C2_TYPE_POLY` switch arm and `ptr_from_parts`’ missing return. Since modifying C is forbidden, those calls have no deterministic C result to match; I’ll keep the deterministic surface fully tested and record these source-definedness exclusions explicitly rather than manufacture passing comparisons."}}
